Title: Judge's Crossword Puzzle No. 171
Author: Catherine MacMillan
Date: 1930-08-30
Byline: Submitted by Catherine MacMillan, Chicago IU.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1930-08-30_99/page/n31/mode/1up
Number: 171
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1930-09-06_99/page/n32/mode/1up
Provenance: The Vertical (Down) clues are printed on the next page (https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1930-08-30_99/page/n32/mode/1up). The pipeline didn't read them across the two pages, so they were typed by hand from the scan. The answer key ran the next week ('Solution of Last Week's Puzzle', https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1930-09-06_99/page/n32/mode/1up); the harvest read it only in pieces, so it is also read from the scan.


